Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Resume reviews whose parent run lives only in the
 Board replica

A review parent created on another gateway has no local run, so _completed_review_run returned None and the owner stayed held by active_pr after an exact-head approval. Read the parent's latest run from the fresh same-board replica (claimed, completed, ended at/after the park) and keep every verdict/exact-head/PR-scope rule. Share the replica snapshot rules with replica_historical_parent. Kanban: t_01a1ceaeb6ba593c
